\par }\pard\plain \s16\li432\sa120\nowidctlpar\widctlpar\adjustright \fs20\lang2057\cgrid {This paper discusses the deployment of secure we
b servers, using them as proxies to back-end systems, load balancing SSL, and other issues of performance and reliability for large-scale systems. We investigate the impact of secure transactions and explore innovative approaches to load sharing in multi-
server environments. This includes distributing session caches and CPU-intensive operations across machines (and to dedicated hardware), and the optimisation of systems that incorporate cryptographic hardware acceleration and key management. 
